  <data key="d0">source</data>
  <data key="d1">API MPMS Chapter 11.1 (2004) / ASTM D1250-04; definition as coded in m2b/API11_1VCF Conversions.cs (SGtoAPI, APItoKgm3 with water density 999.016 kg/m3 at 60 F)</data>
  <data key="d8"></data>
