  <data key="d0">source</data>
  <data key="d1">ASTM D1250-80 / API Standard 2540 / IP 200 (1980) Petroleum Measurement Tables, Tables 53A and 54A. K0 value as used in industrial code (e.g. github.com/Kandimu</data>
  <data key="d8"></data>
  <data key="d9">https://github.com/Kandimus/tritonn/blob/master/src/tritonn/density.h</data>
